For hosted databases, Get(ApplicationLanguage) returns the client''s current language.

FileMaker Pro supports:

- English

- French

- Italian

- German

- Swedish

- Spanish

- Dutch

- Japanese

- Simplified Chinese

- Brazilian Portuguese

- Korean');
