- 0 if the menu bar is hidden and unlocked

- 1 if the menu bar is visible and unlocked

- 2 if the menu bar is visible and locked

- 3 if the menu bar is hidden and locked');
INSERT INTO "calc_help_sections" ("help_page_id", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (519, 5, 'notes', 'Notes', '- In FileMaker Pro and FileMaker WebDirect, the menu bar is always unlocked.');
