Returned value
External event
0
Unknown
1
RemotePlayMedia
2
RemotePause
3
RemoteTogglePlayPause
4
RemotePlayNext
5
RemotePlayPrevious
6
RemoteSeek (begin or end seeking forward or backward)
7
RemoteStop');
INSERT INTO "calc_help_sections" ("help_page_id", "position", "section_key", "heading", "body_text") VALUES (567, 5, 'ref-example1', 'Example 1', 'Controls which media file to play based on the event that activated the OnExternalCommandReceived script trigger on the lock screen or an external device.

Copy

If [Get(TriggerExternalEvent) = 4 ]
    Go to Record/Request/Page [Next ; Exit after last: Off]
    AVPlayer Play [Object Name: "Player"]
Else If [Get(TriggerExternalEvent) = 5 ]
    Go to Record/Request/Page [Previous ; Exit after last: Off]
    AVPlayer Play [Object Name: "Player"]
End If');
